---
alwaysApply: true
---

Always follow best practices from the libraries used. For example, follow Convex, ShadCN, Tanstack, React best practices always. Also follow the style of code that is in the current package.

Do not write useless comments that are obviously AI generated.

Prefer guard clauses over nested ternaries.

You should run this after any change that could impact code:

```sh
bun run build
bun run lint --fix
bun convex dev --once
```
